inta che l'\\\"istinto omicida supremo\\\" sia la chiave per risvegliare Nagi, la sorella, Shizuka, porta il fratello in \\\"riabilitazione\\\" contro spietati nemici!\",\"posterUrl\":\"https://img.altadefinizionex.vip/t/p/w500/d4aAFoLt57BvnRUgdVqj9QDgp7X.jpg\",\"tileUrl\":\"https://img.altadefinizionex.vip/t/p/w780/cFxouAuLIa54PEwYlCFdJwCm0lc.jpg\",\"backdropUrl\":\"https://img.altadefinizionex.vip/t/p/w1280/cFxouAuLIa54PEwYlCFdJwCm0lc.jpg\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://img.altadefinizionex.vip/t/p/w500/oHz8T71b97iUyxHWntULhXRPXh8.png\",\"imdbId\":\"tt43691394\",\"tmdbId\":320377,\"tvdbId\":null,\"wikidataId\":null,\"rating\":\"7.4\",\"durationMin\":null,\"country\":null,\"director\":null,\"cast\":\"Kōki Uchiyama (Nagi Taira (voice)), 藤寺美徳 (Shizuka Taira (voice)), 梶原岳人 (Naozumi Kurosaka (voice)), Saori Hayami (Touko Kurosaka (voice)), 天海由梨奈 (Dr. Radio (voice)), 佐藤元 (Uzu (voice)), 緒方恵美 (Sensei (voice)), Nobuyuki Hiyama (Goro Arashiyama (voice)), Hochu Otsuka (Ryo Takanashi (voice)), Tetsu Inada (YOSHITSUNE (voice))\",\"quality\":\"FHD\",\"trailerKey\":null,\"genres\":[\"Animazione\"],\"status\":\"published\",\"hero\":false,\"upcoming\":false,\"heroOrder\":null,\"heroPosition\":45,\"heroScale\":null,\"heroTrailer\":true,\"scTrailer\":false,\"legacyId\":45241,\"legacyUrl\":null,\"titleIt\":\"TANK CHAIR\",\"titleEn\":\"TANK CHAIR\",\"tagline\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-10-04\",\"releaseStatus\":\"Returning Series\",\"originalLanguage\":\"ja\",\"certification\":null,\"voteCount\":5,\"userRating\":null,\"userVotes\":null,\"inCinema\":false,\"inCinemaManual\":false,\"subIta\":false,\"popularity\":\"13.1721\",\"views\":415,\"productionCountries\":[\"Japan\"],\"spokenLanguages\":null,\"productionCompanies\":null,\"keywords\":null,\"collection\":null,\"networks\":[\"TOKYO MX\"],\"networksData\":null,\"creators\":[],\"homepage\":null,\"facebook\":null,\"instagram\":null,\"twitter\":null,\"videos\":[],\"similar\":null,\"recommendations\":null,\"tmdbExtra\":null,\"posterPaths\":[\"/